@ Start

$ Background {&/Game/Melodia/UI/Textures/Figma/T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_CosmicOrrery.T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_CosmicOrrery} none 0

- Melusina
  The mooring lanterns are bobbing against the sky-current. You can feel the pull of the Sea Above right through the dock planks.

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_road_01.mel_road_01} 0.9

- Sir Melodious
  Careful near the edge! Upward gravity has a sense of humor if your hem isn't tuned for buoyancy. Look at the Starskiff's brass hull—its patina is already humming with the sixteen-second tide.

- .
  At the prow of the moored Starskiff rests the Shorewake Weave—scale-shimmer silk that catches the cyan water-light of the inverted ocean above.

* Attune the Shorewake Weave to the sixteen-second membrane pulse. | -> AcceptWeave
* Ask Sir Melodious why the sky-tide answers a dress and a lyre. | -> InquireCurrents

<@> InquireCurrents

- Melusina
  The water up there doesn't reflect the stars, Sir. It reflects Chladni rings—like the ones on our sheep's fleece, only miles wide.

- Sir Melodious
  Because the Sea Above is not sailed by wind, Melusina. It is sailed by standing waves. The Shorewake Weave acts as a hull-keel for your body, and the Starskiff's lyre cuts the nodal channels ahead of the prow.

-> AcceptWeave

<@> AcceptWeave

- Melusina
  The scale-shimmer thread locks right into the Sorrow Seam. My hands feel weightless—like the sky is offering to hold the instrument for me.

      $ SFX {&/Game/Melodia/Audio/WaveHarp/SW_WaveHarp_Orchestra_C4.SW_WaveHarp_Orchestra_C4} 0.85

$ melodia_shorewake_attuned = on
$ Notify melodia:item:give:item.outfit.shorewake:1
$ Notify melodia:stat:intent.shorewake.resonance:melodia_resonance:5
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.quest.shorewake_completed:true

- Sir Melodious
  And look—because we witnessed the zenith from the balcony, thefourth measure of the Morning House is singing in full unison with the dock!

$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.cutscene.sea_above_witnessed:true
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.sea_above.membrane_pulse_active:true
$ Notify melodia:questcomplete:quest.cutscene.sea_above:flag.cutscene.sea_above_completed:reward.cutscene.sea_above_memory:intent.cutscene.sea_above.complete:checkpoint.cutscene.sea_above.complete
$ Notify melodia:questcomplete:quest.shorewake.initiation:flag.quest.shorewake_completed:reward.shorewake_weave:intent.shorewake.complete:checkpoint.shorewake.complete
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.sea_above.starskiff_ready:true

- Melusina
  No more arriving late. The Starskiff is unmoored, the sheep has the root note, and the tide is ours.

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_arrival_02.mel_arrival_02} 0.9

@ Finish

- .
  Melusina attunes the Shorewake Weave and unlocks the fourth threshold. The Starskiff is ready at the overlook mooring to sail into the Sea Above.

$ End
